&lt;h2 class="heading-element"&gt;Highlights&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;One command&lt;/strong&gt; to start: &lt;code&gt;./scripts/init.sh&lt;/code&gt; — 6 services, 8 dashboards, under a minute&lt;/li&gt;
