&lt;p&gt;These blocks follow the &lt;strong&gt;shadcn/ui component philosophy&lt;/strong&gt;, meaning the source code lives inside your project and is fully editable. That makes them easier to customize compared to traditional UI libraries.&lt;/p&gt;

